/E (Experience: Last season, our rookies learned valuable life-skills and worked all year to strengthen them. At the same time, our veterans developed more self-confidence, along with skill. With many of our members on their second, third, and even fourth year of FTC, our veterans are eager to employ their newfound skills and productive energy into this season.)
