/T (Our organization has a selection process designed to ensure that everyone in our program is committed to robotics and will benefit from being there. After members are admitted, project managers are in charge of putting together a team, with a focus on diversity and varying range of experience and interests. The goal is to give every member of the team a clear role they enjoy, but also the chance to grow and learn from others.)
