/E (Each school year in April, after the competition season has ended, the Westwood Robotics Organization posts flyers around the school at the very start of the school year to advertise robotics. Many times, teams will also recruit within the school asking other robotics members if they wish to join their team for the upcoming year. This recruitment mix of both veterans and new rookies, allow for the team to stay sustainable and continue to be able to add new talent when veterans retire or graduate as well as add new experienced members from other teams who may be able to contribute and guide newer members.  Students apply by filling out an application that will be reviewed by the leadership of each team at the start of the year. Appropriate members are identified using the following guidelines:)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [11]
