/T (This year in order to be financially responsible with our money, we decided to create a sheet with not only our expenses, but our income to plan and pay for it. We hoped by keeping track of our finances, it will make us think more carefully about the value that certain purchases would bring and allow us to truly see if the impact vs cost is truly great enough to justify buying it. This was also critical as in our efforts to fundraise, we learned about the difficulty to fundraise which led us to creating this list of expenses and incomes to help us stay better organized in our efforts to have enough money for the entire season.)
/E (This year in order to be financially responsible with our money, we decided to create a sheet with not only our expenses, but our income to plan and pay for it. We hoped by keeping track of our finances, it will make us think more carefully about the value that certain purchases would bring and allow us to truly see if the impact vs cost is truly great enough to justify buying it. This was also critical as in our efforts to fundraise, we learned about the difficulty to fundraise which led us to creating this list of expenses and incomes to help us stay better organized in our efforts to have enough money for the entire season.)
