584 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (One way we wanted this year to be financially sustainable was through a constant income. Due to many companies and grants only being open for a certain time and only giving a set amount, it was much riskier to acquire and would eventually become difficult later in the season to do so due to restrictions from the companies we reached out to and deadlines from grants. These constraints along with the fact that sponsorship pitches had a relatively low success rate led us to rethink our finances. Instead, we came up with an idea inspired from robocamp: Offer classes for students on how to program FLL level robots and help them improve both their building skills and their programming skills\(Python\) to help spark their interest in FIRST and eventually to join the program with an advantage using the skills they had learned.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
