587 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (Members of our team tutor Barakh and Veda in person weekly. By teaching basic programming language like block programming and building with the Spike LEGO kit, we also give them an introduction to FLL. Through the process of building, finding mistakes, innovating and redesigning the build, the kids problem solving skills improved. and  that made this process meaningful. Additionally, our lesson plan includes CAD and scratch.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
